2026-08-16 16:31:34,805 1035192 DEBUG mcpp.tool CALL plan_task_notes_set args={'name': 'channel-callers-onto-resolver', 'kind': 'plan', 'text': 'SHIPPED a02b911.\n\n  mesh-send.js     throws `channel required` unless channel is an integer. The\n                   chokepoint every sender crosses, so it covers callers that do\n                   not exist yet. It does NOT resolve — only refuses to guess.\n  messages-api.js  400 when the channel is unstated.\n  callout.js       indexFor(gatewayNodeId,\'pub\'), REFUSED when null, recorded on\n                   the callout-withheld hook. config.channel retired.\n  channels.js      setDeviceChannels(device, chans, alias) — each radio registered\n                   under both its MAC and its node id; divergences() keys on the\n                   MAC so an aliased radio reports once.\n  ws-relay.js      passes getLiveNodeIdByMac(addr) as the alias.\n  imap-receiver.js NOT changed — it echoes the arrival channel, which is correct.\n\nTESTS, both in the `fast` group so they run with no radio and no network:\n  tests/test_channels.mjs      42 checks (was 35)\n  tests/test_send_channel.mjs  NEW, 14 checks, registered as `send_channel`\n\nVERIFICATION RUN 2026-08-16:\n  live POST /!2687afb1/messages, no channel -> 400 with the guard\'s message\n  live POST with channel 2                  -> 200 {"id":1507123107}\n  reached-not-present: guard disabled with `if (false && ...)` -> test crashes;\n                       restored -> 14 checks pass\n  regression: @ping over the air -> "16:30 pong YAGI -31dBm 6.0dB 0hop 92%" ch 1\n  npm run check 10 of 12, 1 FAILED node_api (known); check_specs All specs current.\n\nDEFERRED WITH THE REASON: callout\'s refusal path is not exercised live. callout\nships disabled and firing it would put an unattended broadcast on the public mesh\n— Peter\'s switch, not a session\'s. The decision it makes (indexFor(radio,\'pub\')\n-> null for the YAGI) is asserted in test_channels.mjs against the real measured\nchannel shape.\n\nFOLLOW-ON, deliberately not widened into: antenna/radio selection is still spread\nacross dash-mode.transmitterForMode(), getPrimaryMac(), getRotatorAddress() and\nownDeviceNums(). Its own task.'}
