2026-08-16 23:09:23,851 1418298 DEBUG mcpp.tool CALL plan_task_notes_set args={'kind': 'goal', 'text': 'Move the proof of a change from after the fix to before it, and put the verdict in a process that is not the agent.\n\nSpec: /root/.claude/docs/specs/idiot-proof-gate.md\nCaptured before-run: /root/.claude/proofs/gate-refuses-unproven-edit.before.txt\n\nGAP found while starting this, and it matters for the design: plan_file_attach refuses any path outside the project workspace ("file_path escapes workspace"), and no mcpp project is rooted at /root/.claude. So /idiot\'s Phase 0 requirement of an *attached* spec cannot be met for any work on the harness itself. The spec path is recorded here instead, and idiot_gate.py therefore reads the spec path from its own run.json rather than from mcpp — it must not depend on an attachment that cannot exist.'}
