2026-08-16 23:13:56,696 1418298 DEBUG mcpp.tool CALL plan_task_notes_set args={'kind': 'plan', 'text': 'Build the gate first, prove it against the real PreToolUse chain, then write the workflow around it.\n\nProof of works, declared before any code was written:\n  command   python3 /root/.claude/tests/test_idiot_gate.py\n  before    /root/.claude/proofs/gate-refuses-unproven-edit.before.txt  (all hooks exit 0, edit permitted)\n  after     /root/.claude/proofs/gate-refuses-unproven-edit.after.txt   (idiot_gate.py exit 2, edit refused)\n  criterion the eight criteria in the spec, all in one run, exit 0\n\nNot done until the checks have been shown red with each rule removed and green restored.\n\nDesign error found by the test rather than by reading it: the mtime rule was specified in the\ndocument phase, where it cannot discriminate — at implement time the source is not yet edited,\nso a legitimate capture is newer than the source, exactly like a fabricated one. Moved to\nobserve. Spec corrected, then the test.'}
