2026-08-18 09:22:55,235 1035192 DEBUG mcpp.tool CALL plan_task_notes_set args={'kind': 'plan', 'text': "DONE, committed a1f1940.\n\n1. config-api.js DEFAULTS: channels.pub_name '' / pub_psk 'AQ==' / pri_name null / pri_psk null. Removed channels.private_psk_fp (no consumer; its comment named a const PRIVATE_FP_KEY that does not exist).\n2. config-api.js: WITHHELD set — the four keys are served as <key>_present on BOTH GET / and GET /:key, never their values.\n3. channels.js: ROLE_CONFIG_KEY becomes {role: {name, psk}}; designatedKey() derives channelKey(name, psk). Tests the name for STRING-NESS not truthiness, because '' is the correct public name.\n4. tests/test_channels.mjs updated to the pair shape, plus a new regression assert that an EMPTY name is a valid designation.\n5. Live config migrated: fingerprints deleted, pairs written.\n\nEVIDENCE\n - test_channels: 45 checks pass\n - check_specs: All specs current (4 spec hashes bumped; config-api.js is a source of radio-resolve-and-aim and traceroute-args too)\n - GET /config: channels.* served as *_present only; no psk in payload; per-key route returns {present, withheld}\n - private psk not present in any tracked file\n\nMISTAKE MADE AND RECOVERED: ran `git stash -u` mid-task to compare against an earlier commit, which wiped all uncommitted work. Recovered in full with `git stash pop` and re-verified every file and hash. Do not stash to inspect history — read the check's source instead."}
