 ledger entries 84:\n  messages-yagi-control-clipped-on-iphone — REAL. Traced individually rather than\n    assumed to belong with the nine, precisely so it would not be swept away.\n  page-snapshot-layout-cut-at-1280x800 — REAL, uninvestigated. Proven not from the\n    select-caret change by reverting style.css to HEAD (byte-identical failures)\n    and restoring (sha 0684184e…). The test prints only `cut=1` and never names\n    the element; fixing that comes before diagnosing it.'}
